  "content": "<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/banner.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"通过 Crowdin 翻译\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n<p>\n受够了那些像素化严重、选择有限且没有合适图形用户界面的原版画作吗？\nImmersive Paintings（沉浸式绘画）允许用户通过拖放、截图\n或提供网址来创建具有 Minecraft 风格的自定义画作。\n无需资源包，支持多人游戏，简单易用。\n</p>\n<p>该模组提供了一个简单而强大的图形界面，用于选择你的画作、其他玩家的画作或通过\n可选数据包提供的画作。默认数据包已就绪，助你快速开始！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/selector.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>创作菜单让你能够快速对图像进行像素化处理，并应用后期效果和抖动算法，使其看起来\n与 Minecraft 的风格完美融合，无需繁琐的设置。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/editor.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>但是，没有精美的画框，再好的画作也黯然失色？从多种风格和丰富的材质中选择，\n为你的艺术品打造更佳的展示效果。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/frames.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>利用智能细节层次、缓存和数据懒加载技术，性能影响几乎不可察觉。</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/multi.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>还支持发光颜料！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/glow.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>你的图像包含透明通道？没问题，使用涂鸦功能将其喷涂到任何墙壁上！</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/alpha.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>以下是合成配方。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_paintings:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/tree/1.20.1&resolution=48&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的合成配方图片\"></p>\n<p>\n兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/joy-of-painting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joy of Painting</a>！\n只需将画布放在画作上即可展示！\n</p>\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/screenshots/joy.jpg\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<h1>服务器管理员须知</h1>\n<p>\nImmersive Paintings 需要传输和存储图像，在服务器上可能会占用大量资源。如果你的服务器\n带宽较低或存储空间不足，请查看\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Config\" rel=\"nofollow\">配置文件</a>。\n它允许对用户和带宽进行一些限制调整，以适应你的需求。\n</p>\n<h1>数据包</h1>\n<p>\n可选地，使用\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersivePaintings/wiki/Custom-Paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">数据包</a>\n分享画作包。\n</p>\n<h1>翻译</h1>\n<p>\n希望模组能显示为你所使用的语言？请在\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>\n上帮助翻译该模组。\n</p>\n<h1>Immersive Collection（沉浸式合集）</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Armors\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Aircraft\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Melodies\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Paintings\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Optimization\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Man of Many Planes\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Machinery\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Immersive Furniture\">\n</a></p>\n<h1>附加组件</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings-faithful-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Faithful Addon&description=32px texture pack addon for Faithful.&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/629/725/64/64/638028066470632891.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Faithful Addon\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252farids-immersive-resprites\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Arids Immersive Resprites&description=Resprites for the Immersive Melodies and Immersive Paintings mods!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/common/icons/arids-immersive-resprites.webp&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"Arids Immersive Resprites\">\n</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=6686e86ace76d31262ccd37a5e7f80ba\" alt=\"页面哈希值，便于页面部署。\"></p>",
